  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "（2024/12/20記載）諸般の都合により、商品の発売月を変更させていただきました。",
      "en": "(Posted on 2024/12/20) Due to various circumstances, we have changed the product release."
    },
    {
      "ja": "惑星探査を得意とするエグザマクス「ラウンドノヴァ」が登場！",
      "en": "Introducing the Examax \"Round Nova\", which specializes in planetary exploration!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 武器持ち手と開き手の特徴的な形状のハンドパーツが付属。",
      "en": "• Comes with uniquely shaped hand parts for the weapon handle and open hand."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 足底にはスキー板状のパーツを取り付け可能。スキー板状のパーツは腕部にも装着可能。",
      "en": "• Ski-like parts can be attached to the soles of the feet. The ski-shaped parts can also be attached to the arms."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 胸部などに取り付け可能なバッグパーツが付属。",
      "en": "• Includes bag parts that can be attached to the chest etc."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 新デザインのロイロイが付属。ロイロイは腰部に取り付け可能。",
      "en": "• Newly designed Loi Loi is included. Loi Loi can be attached to the waist."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• シリーズ機体と同様に各部がフレキシブルに可動。",
      "en": "• Like the series aircraft, each part is flexible and movable."
    }
  ],
